---
/**
 * The fixed layers behind the content, plus the scroll-progress bar.
 *
 * `.paper` and `.rose` are new in this revision - the page now carries the Homepage's
 * warm paper wash and rose bloom, so the two pages share one atmosphere. Below them sit
 * the emerald-ramp ground, its two very slow radial drifts, and the 120px rule grid,
 * which reads `--gridY` from the page script so it drifts at a fraction of the page speed.
 */
---

<div class="paper" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="rose" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="ground" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="drift a"></span>
  <span class="drift b"></span>
</div>
<div class="grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<div class="prog"></div>
